# Per SPEC-v4 §H4 — consumer-local plugin override and per-feature
# grounding ledgers must not be tracked. The release-dogfood meta-spec
# under .claude/specs/claude-aws-architect/ keeps its ledger committed
# as the canonical reference per §H5; explicit re-include below.
.claude/claude-aws-architect.local.md
.claude/specs/**/.grounding-ledger.json
